      "message": "feat(ui): pick 4-axis wire sync pairs in the viewport\n\nAn armed pick on the Wire Contour page turns two vertex clicks into one\nsync pair in the page draft (upper first, then a lower point below it).\nA flat or higher lower point is refused by name. Stored pairs are drawn\nas rulings; the page names the next click. Apply stays undoable.\n\nFixes #1171\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
